sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant DNS as DNS
    participant FW as Firewall + WAF
    participant LB as LB / reverse proxy
    participant APP as app2
    participant DB as Database
    C->>DNS: A app.t41.lab?
    DNS-->>C: 127.0.41.1 (VIP), TTL 3
    C->>FW: TCP SYN → 127.0.41.1:443 (lab: 18041)
    Note over FW: L3/L4 rule permits, flow added to state table
    C->>FW: GET /api/hello (WAF inspects: clean)
    FW->>LB: forwarded to the VIP
    Note over LB: TLS ends here, path /api/* → pool api,<br/>round robin + health → app2, adds X-Forwarded-For
    LB->>APP: GET /api/hello
    APP->>DB: SELECT … (internal firewall rule: app → DB 5432)
    DB-->>APP: rows
    APP-->>LB: 200 + Server: app2-httpd
    LB-->>C: 200, Server: t41-proxy, Via, Set-Cookie (reply allowed by state)
